# ── Bethesda game data: runtime-only, NEVER committed (see DATA-CLASSIFICATION.md) ──
data/
ARENA2/
arena2/
*.BSA
*.bsa
*.VID
*.vid
*.pal
*.PAL

# ── Retail payload formats (ARENA2 set): never package original game bytes ──
*.EXE
*.exe
